#### What does this implement/fix?
Rewritten the previously Cythonized `linalg.expm` code. Removed excess memory allocations for `m=9, 13`. Performance for small matrices improved significantly (at least on my machine) probably slightly passing the earlier version (cc @domna). Previously erroneous returning cases are now fixed thanks to @eendebakpt discovering the issue due to zero initializing an array instead of one. 

